      </td>
     <td><para unique="1048655">AVX_NE_&#8232;CONVERT</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1048657">Load one BF16 floating-point element from m16, convert to FP32 and store result in ymm1.</para>
      </td>
     </tr>
